      ":question/worked-solution": "- $A$ is lower triangular: **true**. All entries above the main diagonal are zero.\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- ${A}^{T}-A$ is lower triangular: **false**. The entry in row 1, column 2 is $2\\ne 0$, above the main diagonal.\n\n$$\n{A}^{T}-A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $A$ is upper triangular: **false**. The entry in row 2, column 1 is $2\\ne 0$, below the main diagonal.\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
