      ":question/worked-solution": "- $A$ is upper triangular: **false**. The entry in row 3, column 2 is $2\\ne 0$, below the main diagonal.\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $A$ is lower triangular: **false**. The entry in row 2, column 3 is $-2\\ne 0$, above the main diagonal.\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $A+{A}^{T}$ is upper triangular: **true**. All entries below the main diagonal are zero.\n\n$$\nA+{A}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 16\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
